<name>Navigation</name>
<ttl id="1002Q_S000F_746OU_T00CJ" variety="T00CJ">
<name>HDD Navigation System</name>
<para id="RM0000007EM02GX" category="J" type-id="303OK" name-id="652ML-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>AVC-LAN malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000007EM02GX_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ADN00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The HDD navigation system uses AVC-LAN for communication between devices. If a malfunction such as a short between communication lines, short to +B or short to GND occurs in the AVC-LAN circuit, communication is interrupted and the HDD navigation system does not operate normally. In this case, the system returns to normal when the malfunctioning area is disconnected from the AVC-LAN circuit, so the malfunctioning area can be identified.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000007EM02GX_11" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ADO00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E147194J01" width="7.106578999in" height="4.7836529in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000007EM02GX_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ADP00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle not subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001C3R00OX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When replacing the navigation receiver assembly on a vehicle subscribed to the G-BOOK service, perform the vehicle linking setting, then perform the G-BOOK use resumption operation and HELPNET service start operation. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000001C3R00OX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If the navigation receiver assembly is replaced while a purchased G-SOUND unlimited license exists, perform G-SOUND license recovery. (see <xref label="Seep04" href="RM000001C3R00OX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<ptxt/>
</content5>
</subpara>
